sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant KYC as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant Notifications as SVC-053<br/>Notifications
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-107 — Product Selection and Eligibility Check

    Customer->>Channel: Browse savings products → select Cash ISA
    Channel->>Retail: GET /savings/isa-eligibility
    Retail-->>Channel: {eligible: true, subscription_remaining: "20000.00", tax_year: "2026/2027"}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display Cash ISA: AER 4.5%, FSCS protected, £20,000 remaining allowance

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-108 — KYC Verification and Account Application

    Customer->>Channel: Complete ISA declaration + NI number + confirm SCA
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel->>Retail: POST /savings/accounts {product_id, isa_declaration_confirmed: true, national_insurance_number, initial_deposit_amount: "5000.00"}
    Retail->>KYC: Check KYC status (intra-capability)
    KYC-->>Retail: KYC current — no new verification required
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish SavingsAccountApplicationSubmitted (EVT-148)
    EventBus->>KYC: Consume EVT-148 → Set up AML monitoring for new savings relationship

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-109 — Account Provisioning

    Note right of Retail: Create SavingsAccount + IsaSubscriptionRecord<br/>(subscription_used=0, tax_year=2026/2027)
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish SavingsAccountOpened (EVT-149) {account_number, is_isa_wrapper: true}
    EventBus->>Compliance: Consume EVT-149 → FSCS reporting + HMRC ISA notification queue
    Retail-->>Channel: 201 Created {account_id, account_number, sort_code, isa_subscription_remaining: "20000.00"}

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-110 — Initial Deposit and Confirmation

    Note right of Retail: Internal transfer: debit current account £5,000<br/>Credit ISA savings account £5,000<br/>Update IsaSubscriptionRecord: subscription_used=5000
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish IsaSubscriptionUpdated (EVT-150) {subscription_used: "5000.00", remaining: "15000.00"}
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish SavingsDepositMade (EVT-151) {deposit_amount: "5000.00", new_balance: "5000.00"}
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-149 → Dispatch confirmation: account number, AER 4.5%, FSCS protected, £15,000 remaining ISA allowance
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-149 + EVT-150 → Write immutable audit records (HMRC/FSCS 6-year retention)
